WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.751 --> 00:00:08.412
This gallery collects scholar media for the course: the researchers you are reading, speaking for themselves.

2
00:00:08.412 --> 00:00:17.567
Filter by week or browse the whole gallery. Each item names the scholar, the source it connects to, and why it is worth your minutes.

3
00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:26.535
Play inside the page. Videos are embedded with privacy-friendly players. Nothing tracks you into another site while you stay here.

4
00:00:26.535 --> 00:00:34.261
Connect what you watch to the week's reading. A talk is a way into a source, not a replacement for reading it.

5
00:00:34.261 --> 00:00:37.396
Watching is never tracked or graded.

6
00:00:37.396 --> 00:00:42.832
Where next: Open the reading the video connects to in Readings and Media.
